   "doc": "S01",
   "page": 8,
   "quote": "It is crucial that the spectral information obtained by different methods-Mid-IR, NIR, Raman, and fluorescence spectra-is collected from the same small, even pinpoint, area of the sample. This is difficult to achieve by using two probes alternately for measurements.",
